'' A UDT ARGUMENT REACHES A 'const wstring ptr' PARAMETER through its own 'operator cast',
'' with the type in one module and the procedures in another. One procedure takes the
'' 'any ptr' cast; an OVERLOAD SET takes only the typed 'const wstring ptr' one -- fbc-modern
'' prints the same 6, 14 and 4 for the classic program. cast-overload-nomatch.test is the
'' set without that cast.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i tests/modules/src/castovl/libs tests/modules/src/castovl/app/main.tiko -o tests/modules/castovllink.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/modules/castovllink.exe
'' RUN: tests/modules/castovllink.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  6
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  14
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  4
